-- report: /var/www/media/dow2_archive/reports/ai_doctrine/REPLAY_TIMINGS_RU.md
-- Elite 3.0-3.2.1 1v1, 522 matches (>= 5 min), strong = Relic rating >= 2437 (median), built 2026-11-11
-- Times are game seconds from the match start.
-- t2/t3: target = median START of the research (the click in the HQ), lo/hi = p25/p75, n = players who started it;
